- Advertisement scheduling.
- Advertisement selection.
- 16:9 presentation.
- QR placement.
- Playback.
- TV control.
- Return-to-live-TV behaviour.
- Recovery when a component fails.
- Prevention of advertisements continuing into ordinary programming.

Do not assume the system can control every television or broadcast platform.

Identify the actual technical limitations of each supported platform.

